# Runtime dependencies, loosely specified. requirements.txt is generated from
# this with pip-compile — edit this file, never that one.
#
# uvicorn here is unadorned (no [standard] extra): the desktop build has no
# use for uvloop or httptools. uvloop is a compiled extension with no Windows
# support at all, and httptools's throughput gains only matter under load
# that a single local organiser will never produce. The container build adds
# the [standard] extra back via requirements-docker.txt.
